{"seq":1,"slug":"transport-transformation","title":"环境迁移与转化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/fate-exposure/transport-transformation","wordCount":1891,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"环境迁移与转化\">环境迁移与转化</h1><p>一桶溶剂泄漏在工厂的混凝土地面上，几小时后它去了哪里？一部分挥发进入空气随风飘散，一部分渗入土壤向下迁移逼近地下水，溶于雨水的部分被冲入附近溪流，还有一部分被阳光分解、被微生物代谢成别的物质。同一批分子，在大气、水、土壤、生物四种介质之间不断分配、迁移、转化，走向各自不同的归宿。这套「污染物在环境中去哪、变成什么」的过程，就是环境归趋（environmental fate）。理解了它，才能把 <a href=\"../pollutants/\">环境污染物</a> 中各类物质的固有属性，翻译成它们在真实环境中的实际行为，也才能为 <a href=\"exposure-assessment\">暴露评估</a> 提供污染物到达受体的浓度依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>环境归趋由两类过程共同决定：<strong>迁移（transport）</strong>——物质在介质内或介质间的物理移动，本身不改变其化学性质；<strong>转化（transformation）</strong>——通过化学或生物反应改变其分子结构。两者叠加，决定了一个污染物在何处、以何种形态、存在多久。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[污染物释放] --&gt; B{迁移过程}&#10;  B --&gt; C[介质内: 平流+扩散+弥散]&#10;  B --&gt; D[介质间: 分配平衡&lt;br/&gt;气-水-土-生物]&#10;  A --&gt; E{转化过程}&#10;  E --&gt; F[非生物: 光解/水解/氧化]&#10;  E --&gt; G[生物: 微生物降解]&#10;  D --&gt; H[多介质归趋模型]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[各介质中的浓度与形态]\">flowchart TD\n  A[污染物释放] --&gt; B{迁移过程}\n  B --&gt; C[介质内: 平流+扩散+弥散]\n  B --&gt; D[介质间: 分配平衡&lt;br/&gt;气-水-土-生物]\n  A --&gt; E{转化过程}\n  E --&gt; F[非生物: 光解/水解/氧化]\n  E --&gt; G[生物: 微生物降解]\n  D --&gt; H[多介质归趋模型]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[各介质中的浓度与形态]</pre><p>跨介质分配由一组分配系数定量描述，它们是连接物质化学属性与环境行为的桥梁，下表汇总最常用的几个。这些系数同样是 <a href=\"bioaccumulation\">生物富集与放大</a> 中预测富集潜力的关键输入。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分配系数</th>\n<th>描述的平衡</th>\n<th>高值意味着</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>辛醇-水分配</td>\n<td>亲脂，易蓄积于生物脂肪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有机碳-水分配</td>\n<td>易吸附于土壤/沉积物有机质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{aw}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（亨利常数）</td>\n<td>空气-水分配</td>\n<td>易从水体挥发进入大气</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒸气压</td>\n<td>气-固/气-液</td>\n<td>易挥发进入气相</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水溶解度</td>\n<td>溶于水的最大浓度</td>\n<td>易随水迁移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"跨介质分配-决定污染物去向的物理化学量\">跨介质分配：决定污染物去向的物理化学量</h2><p>一个污染物释放后会「自动」分配到它最「偏好」的介质，偏好由其分配系数决定。<strong>辛醇-水分配系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 是最核心的一个，它衡量物质在亲脂相与水相之间的分配倾向。高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（通常大于 4）的物质强烈倾向于离开水相、进入有机相，因此既容易吸附在土壤有机质上，也容易蓄积在生物脂肪里——这正是 <a href=\"../pollutants/persistent-organic\">持久性有机污染物</a> 的共同标志，也是 <a href=\"bioaccumulation\">生物富集与放大</a> 的物理起点。</p>\n<p><strong>有机碳-水分配系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 决定污染物在土壤和沉积物中的吸附强度，进而决定它在地下水中的迁移速度。强吸附的物质被「拖住」，迁移远慢于水流（即发生阻滞）；弱吸附的物质则随水快速移动，更易污染地下水。</p>\n<p><strong>亨利常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{aw}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong> 描述空气-水分配，决定挥发倾向。高亨利常数的物质易从水体逸入大气，这是 <a href=\"../pollutants/persistent-organic\">持久性有机污染物</a> 中「蚱蜢跳效应」全球迁移的物理基础——挥发-沉降的反复正是由温度依赖的气-水分配驱动。一个有用的近似关系是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{aw} \\approx \\frac{P_{vap}}{S \\cdot R T}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即亨利常数大致正比于蒸气压、反比于水溶解度，体现了「易挥发又难溶」的物质最倾向进入大气。</p>\n<h2 id=\"介质内的迁移机制\">介质内的迁移机制</h2><p>分配决定「去哪种介质」，介质内的输运机制则决定「在介质里走多快、扩散多广」。三种基本机制叠加作用：<strong>平流（advection）</strong>——随介质整体流动而被携带，如随河水下泄、随气流扩散，这是远距离输运的主力；<strong>分子扩散（diffusion）</strong>——由浓度梯度驱动从高浓度向低浓度净移动，遵循 Fick 定律，在静止或近静止介质中重要；<strong>机械弥散（dispersion）</strong>——由介质中流速的不均匀（如多孔土壤孔隙间速度差异）造成的额外混合展宽。</p>\n<p>在地下水这种多孔介质中，平流与弥散共同决定污染羽的形状与扩散速度，而吸附（由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 控制）则通过阻滞作用减慢污染物相对于水的迁移。这套迁移图景是污染场地修复设计的基础，其暴露后果的量化属于 <a href=\"exposure-assessment\">暴露评估</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转化过程-非生物与生物降解\">转化过程：非生物与生物降解</h2><p>迁移只是搬家，转化才真正改变分子。<strong>非生物转化</strong>包括：<strong>光解</strong>——紫外光打断化学键，对暴露于水面与大气的污染物尤其重要；<strong>水解</strong>——水分子参与的键断裂，酯类、酰胺类易受其作用；<strong>氧化还原</strong>——改变价态或官能团。<strong>生物转化</strong>则是微生物利用污染物作为能源或共代谢底物将其分解，是许多有机污染物在土壤和水体中消失的主因。</p>\n<p>转化有两条必须警惕的「暗面」。其一，转化不等于无害化——降解产物（代谢物）有时毒性更强或更持久。DDT 降解为更持久的 DDE，三氯乙烯在缺氧条件下可生成致癌性更强的氯乙烯，都是典型例子，这与 <a href=\"../foundations/adme\">吸收分布代谢排泄</a> 中「生物活化」的逻辑如出一辙，只是发生在环境而非体内。其二，<a href=\"../pollutants/persistent-organic\">持久性有机污染物</a> 之所以「持久」，恰恰是因为它们对上述所有转化过程都高度抵抗，而 <a href=\"../pollutants/heavy-metals\">重金属与类金属</a> 作为元素根本无法被降解，只能改变形态（如汞的甲基化），归趋研究中必须区别对待。</p>\n<p>降解速率通常用一级动力学和半衰期描述，与体内消除遵循相同的数学形式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(t) = C_0 \\, e^{-k t}, \\qquad t_{1/2} = \\frac{\\ln 2}{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2543em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>环境半衰期是判断「持久性」的核心定量指标，几天意味着易降解，几年到几十年则归入 POPs 范畴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多介质归趋模型\">多介质归趋模型</h2><p>把上述分配、迁移、转化全部整合，就得到<strong>多介质归趋模型</strong>。这类模型（最经典的是逸度模型，fugacity model）把环境抽象为相互连接的若干「箱子」（大气、水、土壤、沉积物等），用统一的「逸度」概念描述污染物在各箱间的分配趋势，再叠加箱间迁移通量与箱内降解，预测物质在各介质中的稳态浓度和总体停留时间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[释放速率+理化参数] --&gt; B[逸度模型]&#10;  B --&gt; C[大气箱]&#10;  B --&gt; D[水体箱]&#10;  B --&gt; E[土壤箱]&#10;  B --&gt; F[沉积物箱]&#10;  C --&gt;|迁移+降解| D&#10;  D --&gt;|迁移+降解| F&#10;  E --&gt;|迁移+降解| D&#10;  B --&gt; G[各介质稳态浓度&lt;br/&gt;总体环境停留时间]\">graph TD\n  A[释放速率+理化参数] --&gt; B[逸度模型]\n  B --&gt; C[大气箱]\n  B --&gt; D[水体箱]\n  B --&gt; E[土壤箱]\n  B --&gt; F[沉积物箱]\n  C --&gt;|迁移+降解| D\n  D --&gt;|迁移+降解| F\n  E --&gt;|迁移+降解| D\n  B --&gt; G[各介质稳态浓度&lt;br/&gt;总体环境停留时间]</pre><p>到 2026 年，这类模型已与监测数据、地理信息系统和高分辨质谱的非靶向筛查结合，用于预测新化学品上市前的环境分布，是 <a href=\"../risk/testing-regulation\">毒理学测试与法规</a> 中化学品评估和 <a href=\"../risk/ecological-risk\">生态风险评估</a> 中估算环境暴露浓度（PEC）的重要工具。它输出的各介质浓度，正是 <a href=\"exposure-assessment\">暴露评估</a> 估算受体接触量的上游输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>环境归趋由迁移（不改变结构的物理移动）和转化（改变结构的化学/生物反应）共同决定。</li>\n<li>分配系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{ow}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{oc}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_{aw}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把物质的理化属性翻译为它在各介质间的分配倾向。</li>\n<li>介质内迁移靠平流、扩散与弥散叠加，吸附通过阻滞减慢污染物相对水流的速度。</li>\n<li>非生物（光解/水解/氧化）与生物降解改变分子，但降解产物可能更毒，且 POPs 抗降解、金属不可降解。</li>\n<li>环境半衰期是持久性的核心定量指标，遵循与体内消除相同的一级动力学。</li>\n<li>多介质逸度模型整合全部过程，为暴露评估与风险评估提供各介质的预测浓度。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"环境迁移与转化","id":"环境迁移与转化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"跨介质分配：决定污染物去向的物理化学量","id":"跨介质分配-决定污染物去向的物理化学量"},{"level":2,"text":"介质内的迁移机制","id":"介质内的迁移机制"},{"level":2,"text":"转化过程：非生物与生物降解","id":"转化过程-非生物与生物降解"},{"level":2,"text":"多介质归趋模型","id":"多介质归趋模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"新兴污染物与微塑料","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/pollutants/emerging-microplastics"},"next":{"title":"生物富集与放大","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/fate-exposure/bioaccumulation"}}